{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Salman e Farsi (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلیٰ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ مُحَمَّدٍ ابْنِ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ خَاتِمَ النَّبِیِّیْنَ\nalssalamu `ala rasuli allahi muhammadin bni `abdi allahi khatami alnnabiyyina\nPeace be upon the Messenger of Allah, Muhammad the son of `Abdullah, the Seal of the Prophets,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلیٰ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَ سَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ\nalssalamu `ala amiri almu'minina wa sayyidi alwasiyyina\npeace be upon the Commander of the Faithful and master of the successors,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَی الْاَئِمَّۃِ الْمَعْصُوْمِیْنَ الرَّاشِدِیْنَ\nalssalamu `ala al-a'immati alma`sumina alrrashidina\npeace be upon the infallible, rightly-guided Imams,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَی الْمَلٰئِكَۃِ الْمُقَرَّبِیْنَ\nalssalamu `ala almala'ikati almuqarrabina\npeace be upon the angels who are near (to Allah),\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَاحِبَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ الْاَمِیْنِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sahiba rasuli allahi al-amini\npeace be upon you, O companion of the trustworthy Messenger of Allah,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا وَلِیَّ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya waliyya amiri almu'minina\npeace be upon you, O intimate friend of the Commander of the Faithful,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مُوْدَعَ اَسْرَارِ السَّادَاتِ الْمَیَامِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya muwda`a asrari alssadati almayamina\npeace be upon you, O one entrusted with the secrets of the blessed masters,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا بَقِیَّۃَ اللّٰهِ مِنَ الْبَرَرَۃِ الْمَاضِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya baqiyyata allahi mina albararati almadina\npeace be upon you, O remnant of Allah among the righteous who have passed,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya aba `abdi allahi\npeace be upon you, O Abu `Abdullah,\nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ۔\nwa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings."
}
